You are a senior frontend architect, creative director and UI/UX designer. Build a complete, functional, production-quality, multi-page corporate website for Digital Field. (DF.), a premium Digital Performance & Intelligence Consultancy. This is NOT a one-page landing page and NOT a static mockup. Do not stop after the homepage. Deliver every page, every navigation item, every interaction and every section described below, then test and fix.

Work in the phases listed in Section 9. Everything you need is in this brief.

